{"availability":"available","full":"simply-mihir/traffic-demand-prediction","name":"traffic-demand-prediction","description":"Spatio-temporal traffic demand forecasting on a 15-min geohash grid. 42 leak-free features (target encodings, spatial-neighbour spillover, geo-clusters, cyclical time) + stacked ensemble of LightGBM, XGBoost, CatBoost, HGBR, ExtraTrees → 97.85 accuracy. Streamlit demo, geospatial viz, ablation study, error analysis, CI/CD, Docker, MLOps.","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-31T18:27:56Z","updated":"2026-06-12T04:32:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://traffic-demand-prediction-simply-mihir.streamlit.app","topics":["catboost","data-science","data-visualization","demand-prediction","ensemble-learning","exploratory-data-analysis","feature-engineering","geohash","geospatial-analysis","gradient-boosting","lightgbm","machine-learning","model-stacking","python","scikit-learn","spatio-temporal","streamlit","time-series-forecasting","traffic-prediction","xgboost"],"demo":"https://simply-mihir-traffic-demand-prediction.hf.space/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:33.903Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:33.903Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:33.903Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.320Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:48.857Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:26:48.110Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:49:33.903Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](Dockerfile) []( []( [](LICENSE)","Predicting travel demand to help understand urban traffic patterns and alleviate congestion.","This repository tackles a travel-demand forecasting problem: given a city's historical demand aggregated into geohash locations over 15-minute buckets, predict the normalized demand (a value in [0, 1]) for a held-out future window."],"features":["Each row adds one feature group — geohash×time target encodings provide the largest single lift.","Stacking beats every individual model — the Ridge meta-learner exploits diverse error patterns across five model families.","OOF prediction correlation — lower off-diagonal values mean more diverse errors, which is what stacking exploits.","Errors peak during high-demand hours; the model slightly under-predicts demand spikes.","Each row adds one feature group — geohash×time target encodings provide the single largest lift."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/simply-mihir/traffic-demand-prediction/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e1f7038f1b5ce63febe6c71066b734bae3a521acbe133313be9a30af940857a0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.527Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:34.035Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](Dockerfile) []( []( [](LICENSE)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/simply-mihir/traffic-demand-prediction/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e1f7038f1b5ce63febe6c71066b734bae3a521acbe133313be9a30af940857a0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/simply-mihir/traffic-demand-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:34.036Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-12T04:32:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/simply-mihir/traffic-demand-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:34.036Z","hash":"e1f7038f1b5ce63febe6c71066b734bae3a521acbe133313be9a30af940857a0","originalBytes":12912,"storedBytes":12912,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:33.903Z","subjects":["Maps & geospatial","Science","Data & dashboards"],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":["Maps & geospatial","Science","Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Maps & geospatial","source":"metadata","match":"geospatial"},{"subject":"Science","source":"metadata","matc